    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion!\r\n\r\nI understand the reasoning behind `<C-h>` in Insert mode. Does adding explicit mapping like with `vim.keymap.set('i', '<C-h>', '<BS>', { remap = true })` solve this issue?\r\n\r\nI don't understand how you expect other mappings to work. `<C-w>` deletes word before cursor and `<C-u>` deletes all characters before cursor. What are examples of how they should work?",
