            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for suggestion. The proposed approach to handling `<C-h>`, `<C-w>`, and `<C-u>` is now in `main` branch. See [this snippet in `bs()` help](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c16a18124da94fd6d35669a2208b78da0fdd18e2/doc/mini-pairs.txt#L283-L289) for how to set them up.",
